{"3826950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chess, Texas", "steam_appid": 3826950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Texas</strong> is a tactical adventure set in the Wild West, where every duel is settled on the chessboard. Travel from dusty saloons to desert outposts, challenging bandits, bosses, and townsfolk to strategic battles in a handcrafted open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each town hides its own Chess Hall, run by a tough opponent with a unique puzzle theme. Outthink, outplay, and outlast them to earn your place in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, talk, challenge, and conquer—this ain't just chess, it's <i>Chess Texas</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild West Adventure</strong> – Roam across towns, camps, and routes in a stylized cowboy setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/bd2bfa8da4abdd66731cdb787a5de2a9.avif?t=1754027215\" width=800 height=351 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Fights</strong> – Face off in themed chess puzzles against powerful Chess Hall leaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/2f1f0bf3c8b7bc5c8e96d156f8e74a19.avif?t=1754027215\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and Characters</strong> – Meet quirky NPCs, uncover secrets, and piece together the legends of Chess Texas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/42340371db600884dd259ed3b00e127e.